# Cookie consent control (apps/web/src/cookies). Text the administrator can replace per language is set in the admin Cookies tab.
cookies-title = Cookies and browser storage
cookies-preferences-title = Cookie preferences
cookies-body-optin = This site stores information in your browser. Necessary storage keeps you signed in and the site secure. Optional storage for preferences, analytics or marketing is used only if you allow it.
cookies-body-optout = This site stores information in your browser. Necessary storage keeps you signed in and the site secure. Optional storage is on by default; you can turn any of it off.
cookies-body-notice = This site stores information in your browser to keep you signed in and to remember your settings.
cookies-accept-all = Accept all
cookies-reject-all = Reject all
cookies-customize = Choose categories
cookies-save = Save choices
cookies-ok = OK
cookies-close = Close
cookies-policy-link = Cookie policy
cookies-privacy-link = Privacy policy
cookies-always-on = always on
cookies-category-necessary = Strictly necessary
cookies-category-necessary-help = Sign-in, session security and the storage the site needs to work. It cannot be turned off.
cookies-category-functional = Preferences and functions
cookies-category-functional-help = Remembers settings such as theme, language and layout, and syncs your appearance to your account.
cookies-category-analytics = Analytics
cookies-category-analytics-help = Counts visits and use so the operator can see how the site is used.
cookies-category-marketing = Marketing
cookies-category-marketing-help = Used to show or measure promotional content.
cookies-signal-gpc = Your browser sends a Global Privacy Control signal, so analytics and marketing stay off.
cookies-signal-dnt = Your browser sends a Do Not Track signal, so analytics and marketing stay off.
cookies-reconsent-version = The cookie policy changed since your last choice. Please review your choices.
cookies-reconsent-expired = Your last choice has expired. Please choose again.
cookies-show-items = Show what is stored
cookies-hide-items = Hide what is stored
cookies-decided = Your last choice: { $date }
cookies-preferences-link = Cookie preferences
cookies-settings-title = Cookies and browser storage
cookies-settings-help = Review what this site may store in your browser, change your choices, or check this browser's storage now.
cookies-settings-current = Current choices
cookies-state-on = on
cookies-state-off = off
cookies-scan-now = Check storage now

# What each stored item is for (cookies-inv-<inventory id>)
cookies-inv-session = Keeps you signed in to the mail app.
cookies-inv-csrf = Protects requests made while you are signed in against forgery.
cookies-inv-admin-session = Keeps an administrator signed in to the admin console.
cookies-inv-admin-browser = Marks a browser used for the admin console so the analytics tag is not loaded in it.
cookies-inv-client-access = Holds the proof of a client-access check when the administrator requires one.
cookies-inv-consent = Remembers your cookie choices and when the browser last scanned its storage.
cookies-inv-secure-store = Browser fallback store for sign-in material the app must keep between visits.
cookies-inv-boot-session = Tells the start-up screen whether a session existed, to avoid a flash of the wrong screen.
cookies-inv-bundle-reload = Prevents a reload loop when a new version of the app is loaded.
cookies-inv-appearance = Remembers theme, density and accent, and the state of syncing them to your account.
cookies-inv-boot-appearance = Start-up screen theme and window layout, so the app opens as you left it.
cookies-inv-language = Remembers the language you chose.
cookies-inv-layout = Remembers the reading-pane layout.
cookies-inv-workspace = Remembers open tabs and workspace layout.
cookies-inv-session-restore = Reopens the folder and message you had open.
cookies-inv-compose-drafts = Keeps unsent drafts and composer layout in this browser.
cookies-inv-prefs = Remembers settings that apply to this browser only.
cookies-inv-account-prefs = Holds account preference changes that have not reached the server yet.
cookies-inv-sign-ins = Remembers addresses that signed in on this browser, never passwords, when the administrator allows it.
cookies-inv-local-lists = Remembers tags, blocked senders, focused senders and similar lists.
cookies-inv-local-lists-2 = Remembers blocked senders.
cookies-inv-local-lists-3 = Remembers focused senders.
cookies-inv-viewer = Remembers the maximum-security message viewer choice.
cookies-inv-assist = Remembers assistant suggestions you turned on or off.
cookies-inv-colors = Remembers recently used colours.
cookies-inv-notices = Remembers that you dismissed a new-version notice.
cookies-inv-migrate = Remembers a collapsed migration panel.
cookies-inv-admin-prefs = Admin console appearance, language, hidden checklist items and table layout.
cookies-inv-admin-misc = Admin console and feature-profile memory.
cookies-inv-notification-prompt = Remembers that you deferred the notification prompt.
cookies-inv-admin-session-mark = Tells the admin console why a session ended.
cookies-inv-offline-db = Offline copy of mail and search data on this device, when you use offline mode.
